# =============================================================================
# power-mesh-client — PRODUCTION (static export) environment template
# Same approach as Healthcare-Client: `next build` → `out/`, serve with
# `npx serve@latest out` (or any static host). Browser talks to Express directly.
# =============================================================================

# Express origin for build-time ISR fetches. No trailing slash.
API_URL=https://your-api.example.com

# Absolute API base baked into the client bundle (required for static hosting).
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.example.com/api/v1

# Public app origin. Must equal FRONTEND_URL on the API (CORS + payment return).
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://your-app.example.com

NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id.apps.googleusercontent.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_LOGIN=false

# Shared with power-mesh-server ISR_SERVICE_TOKEN (long random secret).
ISR_SERVICE_TOKEN=replace_with_a_long_random_isr_token
